OL,3,GNEWSABlaze rips through vehicle repair
OL,4,Aworkshop
OL,5,
OL,6,FA late-night blaze broke out at a
OL,7,Fvehicle repair workshop, sending a
OL,8,F"large plume of smoke" over the
OL,9,Fsurrounding area.
OL,11,FSunday's fire broke out in a unit on
OL,12,FLower Hollin Bank Street in Blackburn
OL,13,Fand was reported at shortly after 22:00
OL,14,FGMT.
OL,16,FLancashire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,17,Fcrews tackled the flames into the early
OL,18,Fhours and the cause of the blaze is
OL,19,Fstill being investigated.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
